<main class="page-main info-page">
  <header class="category-hero">
    <h1>Crystal Guide</h1>
    <p class="category-description">
      A simple, beginner-friendly guide to some of the crystals you’ll see around RockBay.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="coming-soon">
    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Common themes people use</h2>
    <ul class="info-list">
      <li><strong>Clear Quartz</strong> – often used for clarity, focus, and “amplifying” intentions.</li>
      <li><strong>Amethyst</strong> – linked with rest, calm, and intuitive work.</li>
      <li><strong>Rose Quartz</strong> – associated with self-love, compassion, and gentle heart energy.</li>
      <li><strong>Citrine</strong> – frequently chosen for abundance, confidence, and motivation.</li>
      <li><strong>Black Obsidian / Tourmaline</strong> – commonly used for grounding and protection themes.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="margin: 1.25rem 0 0.5rem;">How to work with them</h2>
    <ul class="info-list">
      <li>Keep a stone on your desk as a reminder of the intention you set.</li>
      <li>Use points or clusters near spaces where you journal, game, or study.</li>
      <li>Create a small tray or bowl with a few pieces you rotate seasonally.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
